  - id: universal-defense-ring
    reason: "ring geometry pinned so the loop cannot 'fix' the corner-loop gap by shrinking the ring; P0 universal-defense"
    file: data/tuning.yaml
    path: ring
  - id: universal-defense-ai-decision-interval
    reason: "cast-wide AI cadence is a defensive-fairness rule, not a per-character knob; P0 universal-defense"
